#: ../../builtins/time-complexity.rst:225
msgid ":class:`!memoryview`"
msgstr ":class:`!memoryview`"

#: ../../builtins/time-complexity.rst:227
msgid ""
":class:`memoryview` objects allow Python code to access the internal data of "
"an object that supports the :ref:`buffer protocol <bufferobjects>` without "
"copying. In particular, slicing a memory view returns a new view onto the "
"same buffer."
msgstr ""
":class:`memoryview` 物件讓 Python 程式碼可以在不複製的情況下，存取支援"
"\\ :ref:`緩衝區協定 <bufferobjects>`\\ 之物件的內部資料。特別是，對記憶體視圖"
"進行切片會回傳一個指向同一個緩衝區的新視圖。"

